ea:CollegeAdmissionsTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Test .
ea:InternationalComparisonTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Test .
ea:PsychologicalTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Test .
ea:MidtermExam a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Test .
ea:FinalExam a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Test .
